      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-63316",
      ":question/problem": "Gabrielle used an app to track the total time she spends per day on social media. For the first week of tracking, she calculated an interquartile range (IQR) of $2$ hours. The times she spent on social media per day during the second week (in hours) are given below:\n$2, 2.5, 3, 4, 4.5, 4.5, 5$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. The IQR for the second week is $2.5$ hours.\n2. The IQR for both weeks is the same.\n3. There is a greater variation in the time she spent on social media in the second week compared to the first.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
    }
